'''Thorned Vines''' is a debuff that is applied by monsters with the [[List of archnemesis mods|Entangler]] [[Archnemesis]] modifier.

This debuff applies a movement impairing effect as well as a continuous Chaos DOT and stacks. 

In order to remove the debuff, the player must move around for how many stacks of Thorned Vines that still persist.

